        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Rudd\n- Organizations: AC/DC\n- Products: AC/DC's third LP\n- Topics: band membership, bass guitar, release history\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, AC/DC released its third LP in Australia and in Europe.\n- The individual who played bass guitar on AC/DC's third LP later left the band.\n- After that departure, Phil Rudd became the only Australian-born member of AC/DC.",
